  <section class="mp-section" id="telemarketing-pricing"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">05 / Investment and fit</p><h2>Price the account groups,<br>coverage and follow-through.</h2><p class="mp-price">From US$4,000<span> / month</span></p><p>The starting managed programme assumes a clear B2B offer, defined market, usable accounts or contacts, CRM and calendar access, and sellers ready for meetings.</p><p>Fresh research, licensed data, additional markets and expanded calling capacity affect the final fee. Most programmes begin with an initial three-month engagement.</p><p><a href="/pricing/#meeting-cost-example">See pricing and the held-qualified-meeting cost example</a>. Agree the complete workload and terms before launch.</p></div><aside class="mp-tool"><h3>Does the campaign<br>make commercial sense?</h3><p>Model the investment against your customer value and realistic sales assumptions. Then compare the proposed work, meeting standard and full costs.</p><a class="mp-button" href="/b2b-lead-generation-roi-calculator/">Calculate Your Campaign ROI ↗</a><p class="mp-small">Working from several quotes? Use the <a href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">agency proposal comparison</a>.</p></aside></div></section>
